Z||000001||Raydar||10-02-2001||07:06 AM||||GTU was a class of IMSA racer. Fiero GTU was a race car. Tube frame. SD-4 engine, etc. Won quite a few races.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>The SD-4 was (is) a race engine. Not really designed for street use, although there are probably a few around. I've never seen one, though. Think "special block and head castings, big carbs, big port heads, etc". Think $$$$$!!!<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 10-02-2001).]||||reg||1
